    "result": {"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>Industry Context:</strong> Tailored for the Textile &#x26; Garments industry to handle bulk fabric washing, dyeing, and chemical treatment cycles automatically.</li>\n<li><strong>Core Operation:</strong> Utilized Forward-Reverse (F-R) motor control circuits to handle bi-directional drum rotations required for different washing stages.</li>\n<li><strong>Logic Design:</strong> Programmed complex Timer and Counter logic via PLC to accurately manage wash, rinse, and spin-dry durations.</li>\n<li><strong>User Interface:</strong> Interfaced the system with an HMI (Human-Machine Interface), allowing factory operators to easily input parameters, monitor real-time progress, and adjust chemical dosing.</li>\n<li><strong>Associated With:</strong> Ulterior Engineering Ltd.</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Industrial Washing Machine Automation","date":"2026-07-03","tech":["PLC Programming","HMI Interfacing","F-R Motor Control","Timer/Counter Logic"],"github":"","external":"","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/6fabf/washing-machine.png","srcSet":"/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/1086c/washing-machine.png 250w,\n/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/136bd/washing-machine.png 500w,\n/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/6fabf/washing-machine.png 1000w","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/f686b/washing-machine.avif 250w,\n/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/44b8e/washing-machine.avif 500w,\n/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/223ae/washing-machine.avif 1000w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 1000px) 1000px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/dfeda/washing-machine.webp 250w,\n/static/bb170e83db4ec866b58e573535c620cc/c462c/washing-mac